            "text": "<p>{dogs} review of your year, printed for the wall: your name, {dogs} headshot and the three notes you picked, on a 12 × 18 inch poster of thick matte paper.</p><p>Frame not included. {dog} has requested one in next year's budget. Made after you order, and a person checks it before it prints. Free US shipping.</p>"
          }
