            "text": "<p>The same review, framed and ready to hang. {dog} felt the paperwork deserved it.</p><p>A 12 × 18 inch poster on thick matte paper, in a black, red oak or white wood frame, with the hanging hardware already on. Made after you order, and a person checks it before it prints. Free US shipping.</p>"
